{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764072,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Campus Rise present: JavaScript Mastery Challenge 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":941564,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-31T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/campus-rise-present-javascript-mastery-challenge-2026-viva-college-of-arts-commerce-and-science-1764072","region":"online","details":"<p>The <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"532\">JavaScript Mastery Challenge 2026<\/strong> is an online MCQ-based quiz designed to test and improve participants' knowledge of JavaScript&mdash;from <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"676\">basic fundamentals to advanced concepts<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>The quiz contains <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"743\">30 carefully designed JavaScript questions<\/strong> covering important concepts that every aspiring web developer should know.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you're a beginner learning JavaScript, a college student preparing for placements, or an aspiring developer looking to test your skills, this challenge is a great opportunity to <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1054\">learn, compete, and showcase your knowledge.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1204\">Top performers will be recognized with special Winner\/Rank certificates, while every participant will receive a Certificate of Participation.<br \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Important &mdash; Join the WhatsApp Community<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>After registering for the event, joining the Campus Rise WhatsApp Community is mandatory.<\/li>\n<li>All important event updates, announcements, quiz instructions, and certificate-related information will be shared through the community.<\/li>\n<li>Join the Campus Rise WhatsApp Community:<a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/KeWyauSPYkt5psRlBaTvIX\"> https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/KeWyauSPYkt5psRlBaTvIX<\