rd<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14pu9l3\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1600\">DOM Basics<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tedz\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1609\">Events<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5ei4k\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1625\">ES6+ Features<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ow7qrd\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1641\">Destructuring<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnjvi4\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1667\">Spread &amp; Rest Operators<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"tc86uf\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1690\">Advanced Level<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1855\">\n<li data-section-id=\"cy53be\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1701\">Closures<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywhzte\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1713\">Callbacks<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f9oew4\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1724\">Promises<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1c96jt7\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1738\">Async\/Await<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11lzkd4\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1751\">Event Loop<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"30wc85\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1771\">Execution Context<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mfo4yd\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1784\">Prototypes<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12s39b7\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1809\">Higher-Order Functions<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"135i1en\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1826\">Error Handling<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qiaixj\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1855\">Modern JavaScript Concepts<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1573fej\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2978\">Rules &amp; Regulations<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3711\">\n<li data-section-id=\"unw8qf\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3044\">The quiz consists of <strong data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3043\">30 Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs)<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq8ig7\" data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3127\">Questions will cover <strong 